title: The Eastern-Border Regime
subtitle: Begin with a lawful, audited border service under civilian command; a statutory footing is a fallback, not a first rung.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_major_reform_card
frequency: 130
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_border_reform_timer <= 0 and border_reform_settled = 0 and border_on_slate = 1 and reform_pressure_pending = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.poland_border_reform_timer = 3;
Q.border_reform_next_stage = Number(Q.border_reform_proposal_stage) || 4;
// The public is with us on border capability, so the ladder is cheap to climb
// and the fight is about civilian control rather than the wire itself.
const thresholds = [0, 22, 36, 52, 72];
Q.border_reform_threshold = thresholds[Q.border_reform_next_stage];
const ministryBonus =
    (Q.interior_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 11 : 0) +
    (Q.defence_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 6 : 0);
const koCabinet = Q.government_party == "ko" || Q.ministry_ko_in_cabinet;
const pslCabinet = Q.government_party == "psl" || Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet;
const p2050Cabinet =
    Q.government_party == "p2050" || Q.ministry_p2050_in_cabinet;
const thirdWayCabinet = pslCabinet || p2050Cabinet;
let partnerBonus = 0;
if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
    partnerBonus =
        Number(Q.pis_relation) * 0.14 +
        Number(Q.border_pis_commitment) * 7 +
        Number(Q.pis_accept_order) * 0.10 - 12;
} else {
    partnerBonus =
        (koCabinet
            ? Number(Q.ko_relation) * 0.10 +
                Number(Q.ko_accept_order) * 0.10 +
                Number(Q.border_ko_commitment) * 6
            : 0) +
        (thirdWayCabinet
            ? Number(Q.border_third_way_commitment) * 5 +
                Number(Q.psl_agrarian_pragmatist_share) * 0.04
            : 0);
}
const palaceBonus =
    Number(Q.president_relation) * 0.06 +
    (Q.border_palace_president == Q.president_name
        ? Number(Q.border_palace_commitment) * 6
        : 0);
const publicBonus =
    (Number(Q.border_security_support) - 45) * 0.35 +
    Number(Q.migration_border_competence) * 0.16 +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_poll) - 5) * 0.45 -
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.border_security_backlash) - 50) * 0.10;
Q.border_reform_power = Math.round(Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        140,
        Number(Q.border_reform_progress) * 0.62 +
        partnerBonus + palaceBonus + publicBonus + ministryBonus
    )
));
Q.reform_ceiling_issue = "border";
Q.reform_ceiling_target = Q.border_reform_next_stage;
!}
call: poland_reform_ceiling
card-image: img/poland/cards/oversight-delivery.webp

= The border regime as a whole-game project

**Campaign goal:** [? if border_reform_defined: [+ border_reform_goal_label
+].?][? if not border_reform_defined: Not yet defined.?]
[? if border_reform_defined: **Bill currently on the table:** [+
border_reform_next_label +].
**Passage power:** **[+ border_reform_power +]**; tabling this bill needs **[+
border_reform_threshold +]**.
**Settlement ceiling:** [+ reform_ceiling_tier_label +] — [+
reform_ceiling_reachable_label +].
[? if reform_ceiling_blocker_kind != "none": Binding veto player: **[+
reform_ceiling_blocker_name +]** — scores the bill [+
reform_ceiling_blocker_score +] against the [+ reform_ceiling_need +] a tier-[+
reform_ceiling_target_resolved +] settlement needs.?]
[+ reform_ceiling_breakdown +].?][? if not border_reform_defined: The first
project action must define the ambitious bill before preparation or bargaining
can begin.?]

This is the rare field where the Left is not arguing against the country. A
capable, funded, accountable border service is broadly popular. The fight is
over who commands it, whether the emergency zone has statutory limits and
whether anyone audits what happens inside it.

[? if border_security_support >= 60: A broad mandate is available here. The
usual problem — a public majority against us — does not apply, and the
resistance is institutional rather than electoral.?]

[? if government_party = "pis": PiS will fund the wire and fight civilian
oversight of it. That is the whole negotiation.?][? if government_party != "pis":
Every partner will vote for capability. Civilian command, published rules and
an audit trail are where the votes get expensive.?]

- @define_goal
- @draft
- @coalition_round
- @cash_relation
- @ministry
- @palace
- @advance

@define_goal
title: Define the goal as a lawful border service under civilian command
subtitle: Capability, statutory limits, published rules and an audit trail enter as one demand.
view-if: border_reform_defined = 0
on-arrival: border_reform_defined = 1; border_on_slate = 1; border_reform_goal_stage = 4; border_reform_proposal_stage = 4; border_reform_next_stage = 4; border_reform_progress += 12; government_delivery += 1; public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 7; public_mood_pending_border_security_salience += 9; public_mood_pending_border_security_left_ownership += 8; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 10; news_headline = "Lewica defines a lawful, audited border service as its security bill"

The Left has spent years being told it has no border policy. Naming one that is
both capable and accountable takes the argument away.

- #poland_card_finish

@draft
title: Keep the border service, lawyers and auditors drafting
subtitle: Free. Preparation +10.
view-if: border_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: border_reform_progress += 10; migration_border_competence += 1; public_mood_pending_border_security_salience += 3; news_headline = "Lewica keeps its border-service statute ready for the next opening"

Officers who work the strip, the lawyers who litigate it and the auditors who
would police it produce one statute rather than three competing instincts.

- #poland_card_finish

@coalition_round
title: Put the border-command file on a partner's table
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Choose KO, [+ third_way_display_name +] or PiS and record one commitment.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A serious negotiating round needs one resource.
view-if: border_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

- @round_ko
- @round_third_way
- @round_pis

@round_ko
title: Ask KO to record a civilian-oversight floor
on-arrival: resources -= 1; border_reform_progress += 8; border_ko_commitment += 1; ko_relation += 4; public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 6; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 5; news_headline = "KO records a civilian-oversight floor for the border regime"

- #poland_card_finish

@round_third_way
title: Make [+ third_way_display_name +] name the border rules it would publish
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
on-arrival: {! Q.public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 5; Q.public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support -= 5; Q.resources -= 1; Q.border_reform_progress += 8; Q.border_third_way_commitment += 1; Q.psl_relation += 4; Q.p2050_relation += 3; Q.news_headline = Q.third_way_display_name + " records published rules for the border strip"; !}

- #poland_card_finish

@round_pis
title: Trade capability funding with PiS for statutory limits
choose-if: (left_in_government = 1 and government_party = "pis") or pis_relation >= 15 or national_crisis_pressure >= 20
unavailable-subtitle: PiS will not trade on the border without coalition ties, a channel or national pressure.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; border_reform_progress += 8; border_pis_commitment += 1; pis_relation += 4; public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 9; public_mood_pending_border_security_backlash += 4; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support -= 5; news_headline = "PiS trades border funding for a statutory footing"

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_relation
title: Cash in a party relationship instead of spending a resource
subtitle: Choose a 55+ relationship; it falls by 10 and becomes one recorded commitment.
choose-if: ko_relation >= 55 or pis_relation >= 55 or ((p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1) and (psl_relation >= 55 or p2050_relation >= 55))
unavailable-subtitle: No potential governing partner trusts us enough yet.
view-if: border_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

- @cash_ko
- @cash_third_way
- @cash_pis

@cash_ko
title: Spend KO goodwill on civilian command of the border
choose-if: ko_relation >= 55
on-arrival: ko_relation -= 10; border_ko_commitment += 1; border_reform_progress += 10; public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 7; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 8; news_headline = "Lewica converts KO goodwill into civilian border command"

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_third_way
title: Spend [+ third_way_display_name +] goodwill on border accountability
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
choose-if: psl_relation >= 55 or p2050_relation >= 55
on-arrival: {!
if (Number(Q.psl_relation) >= Number(Q.p2050_relation)) {
    Q.psl_relation -= 10;
} else {
    Q.p2050_relation -= 10;
}
Q.border_third_way_commitment += 1;
Q.border_reform_progress += 10;
Q.public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 5;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica converts " + Q.third_way_display_name + " goodwill into border accountability";
!}

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_pis
title: Spend PiS goodwill on a statutory border footing
choose-if: pis_relation >= 55
on-arrival: pis_relation -= 10; border_pis_commitment += 1; border_reform_progress += 10; public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 9; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support -= 4; news_headline = "Lewica converts PiS goodwill into a statutory border footing"

- #poland_card_finish

@ministry
title: Make the Interior Ministry produce the command and audit file
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Preparation +14.
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and budget >= 1 and (interior_minister_party = "Lewica" or defence_minister_party = "Lewica")
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Interior or Defence portfolio and one budget point.
view-if: border_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; border_reform_progress += 14; administrative_capacity += 2; migration_border_competence += 4; government_delivery += 1; public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 8; public_mood_pending_border_security_salience += 6; public_mood_pending_border_security_left_ownership += 9; news_headline = "The Interior Ministry maps border command, rules of engagement and audit"

Command lines, rules of engagement and audit powers acquire names and dates.
Nobody can argue that accountability would break the service.

- #poland_card_finish

@palace
title: Put the border-command file before the President
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Presidential commitment +1; preparation +6.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Palace delegation needs one resource.
view-if: border_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
if (Q.border_palace_president != Q.president_name) {
    Q.border_palace_commitment = 0;
    Q.border_palace_president = Q.president_name;
}
Q.border_palace_commitment += 1;
Q.border_reform_progress += 6;
Q.president_relation += 3;
Q.public_mood_pending_border_security_salience += 5;
Q.public_mood_pending_national_security_salience += 4;
Q.news_headline = "The Palace receives the border command and audit protocol";
!}

The President is commander-in-chief and this file is written for that office
rather than around it. On security questions almost every Palace has room to
move, which is why this is the one field where a hostile President can still be
brought most of the way.

- #poland_card_finish

@advance
title: Table the bill: [+ border_reform_next_label +]
subtitle: Requires government and passage power at or above the displayed threshold; veto players may force a narrower final settlement.
view-if: border_reform_defined = 1
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and border_reform_power >= border_reform_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: We either lack executive access or have not assembled enough coalition, public and presidential power.
on-arrival: reform_pressure_issue = "border"; reform_pressure_target_stage = border_reform_proposal_stage; reform_pressure_previous_stage = 0; reform_pressure_return_mode = "card"; reform_pressure_palace_override = 0; reform_pressure_referendum_used = 0
go-to: poland_major_reforms.resolve
